4. Handles potential race conditions when multiple processes attempt to set the environment variable simultaneously.
5. Optimized for performance by using Interlocked.Exchange and locking mechanisms.
6. Efficiently handles large XML files without consuming excessive memory by reading the file only once per call.
7. Designed to be easily extendable for additional modules without altering core logic.
8. Minimizes impact on system performance and resource usage during high-load scenarios.']

