The `init()` method initializes the service by checking the status of the external API and setting up event listeners for CPU usage updates. The `start()` method runs continuously (with a delay based on the rate limit) to collect data, write it to the stream, and call itself recursively. The `collectData()` method should be implemented to handle actual data collection logic.

